The text-only CATMuS fixtures under inst/extdata/ contain excerpts derived from
CATMuS Medieval Samples / CATMuS Medieval and are distributed under the terms
of the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

Source:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/CATMuS/medieval-samples
https://huggingface.co/datasets/CATMuS/medieval

The controlled prediction fixture contains transformations of those public
transcriptions and is not OCR/HTR model output.

See inst/extdata/CATMUS_ATTRIBUTION.md for attribution and methodological notes.
